{"id":"wb-1-104","name":"西安城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西安城墙","text":"西安城墙是环绕陕西省西安市明清城区的城墙，现存主体建于明洪武年间。明代城墙利用隋唐长安城皇城及其后城垣的部分基础扩建而成，此后历代修缮，构成由墙体、城门、瓮城、敌台、角楼和护城河组成的城市防御体系。\n城墙平面近长方形，周长约13.74公里，围合区域约12平方公里。其规模和保存状况使其成为研究中国明清府城规划、防御工程和西安城市沿革的重要实物遗存。1961年，西安城墙列入第一批全国重点文物保护单位；2008年又作为“明清城墙”项目的一部分列入中国世界遗产预备名单。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":94116134,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94116134","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a6c531f079913723f7fc0d4c.jpg","title":"City_wall_of_Xi'an_51550-Xian_(27959363326).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:City_wall_of_Xi%27an_51550-Xian_(27959363326).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/City_wall_of_Xi%27an_51550-Xian_%2827959363326%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"xiquinhosilva","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","caption":"51550-Xian","width":320,"height":212}}